## Resolved mutable: build-surface

docker version: 'error during connect ... dockerDesktopLinuxEngine: cannot find file' = Docker Desktop installed (/c/Program Files/Docker/Docker/Docker Desktop.exe present) but daemon NOT running; starting it needs interactive GUI launch + ~60s engine boot (heavy side effect). User explicitly chose 'Fork + build via CI'. Decision: use GitHub Actions build-blink.yml (emsdk 3.1.69) as the build surface; local Docker is fallback only. CI is authorized + sufficient.